      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-01",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "林琛，你好。我是Hermitage的店主，宁嘉茂已经把你的来意告诉我了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-02",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "您好。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-03",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "四年前，我接手过罗尧的一项委托。有些东西，至今还保存在店里。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-04",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "是《续算杂录》？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-05",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "《续算杂录》是本店的藏品。那些抄本只是他当时查找的资料，并不是委托本身。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-07",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "在回答你的问题之前，我想先确认一件事。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-09",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "你已经知道2021年6月25日发生了什么，对吗？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-06",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我知道他那天因为山洪意外去世了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-08",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "但现在我也明白了，就算没有那场山洪，他恐怕也不会再回来……是他为我借了命。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-11",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "是的。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-13",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "他回去，不仅因为那里是他的故乡，也为了见从前的师兄弟，把该交代的事情交代清楚。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-15",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "毕竟那个时候，谁也无法向他保证，这件事一定会成功。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_intro-v21-13",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "我这里还留着当年的一部分委托记录。如果你愿意，可以先看看。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "OWNER_ARCHIVE_GATE",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-10",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "她说，他是为了另一种叫「易命」的法子回去的。",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-12",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "他早就知道自己可能回不来了？",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-intro-14",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-archive-system",
          "speakerId": "system",
          "text": "店主向您开放了历史档案。",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "OWNER_ARCHIVE_GATE",
      "nodeType": "archive",
      "nextNodeId": "OWNER_AFTER_ARCHIVE",
      "requiredArchiveId": "commission-2021"
    },
    {
      "nodeId": "OWNER_AFTER_ARCHIVE",
      "nodeType": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-01",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我看完了。所以学校一直没有收到归还的书，是因为它还在您这里？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-02",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "对。那本书至今仍然封存在Hermitage。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-03",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可他为什么非得用学校的书？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-04",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "你或许听说过「阳契」。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-05",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "没有。我以为那都是小说要素之类。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-06",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "在许多古老的信仰里，名字是极为重要的神秘学符号。除中国外，古埃及的秘名、希腊魔法中的咒名与铅板、所罗门仪式魔法的符印，乃至日本神道的形代，都有借助有形之物，与无形之事建立联系的观念。民间所谓「阳契」，内涵也是这个道理：取现世物品，为那些无法用寻常方式记录之事，在阳间留下一份可以追溯的凭据。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-07",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "当年罗尧找到的法子，完整的秘仪叫作*「寄寿留契」*。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-08",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "*罗尧四年前就用自己的余寿替你借了命，等到你姐姐续满的年岁到期，如果你已经亲自归籍，罗尧那份寿命便会接续到你身上，整个秘仪就会完整生效。但是为此，他还得在阳世留下一份契据。*",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-09",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "最后选中了那本大学馆藏书，只是在情急之下就地取材，让留契能够迅速完成。这本书已经有明确的借阅记录，谁借走、何时谁应当归还，最后由谁负责，只要书没有归还，这件事情就不会轻易从东澜大学图书馆的记录里消失。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-10",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "所以我学校里的那条欠费记录……就是那份阳契留在世间的痕迹。那{amountYuan}元呢？难道还清就可以了？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-11",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "钱本身并没有什么特别的意义，那是图书馆对于未归还馆藏的处理金额。真正重要的是你以自己的名义，确认愿意承担这笔责任。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-12",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "这就是*「归籍」*。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-13",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "对。这本书只是凭证。你的名字出现在记录上，并不意味着归籍已经完成，必须由你亲自作出确认。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-14",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可这些事我以前完全不知道。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-15",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "罗尧当时也想过，如果你始终不知道这些事情该怎么办，如果你最后查清了当年的真相又会发生什么。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-16",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "最后他说，那也没关系。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-17",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "如果你顺利地完成了归籍仪式，本身就是完成他心愿的最好设想。他原本就没打算让你为了知道这些事，再去承担什么。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-18",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "如果你最后找到了这里，我会如他所托将所知的一切告知于你。你能够活下去是罗尧此生唯一执着的事，希望你能原谅他的私心。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-19",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-20",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "林琛，四年前所有的真相，你已经知道了。至于这份凭证最后要怎样处理，现在由你决定。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_after_archive-final-21",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "你打算怎么处理那笔借阅记录？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        }
      ],
