    {
      "nodeId": "OWNER_BRANCH_B",
      "nodeType": "messages",
      "messages": [
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-01",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "林琛，你可以不用这么快做出决定。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-02",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我知道。其实这些年，我一直觉得自己已经慢慢接受他的离开了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-03",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我重新上了学，认识了新的朋友，也有了以后想做的事情，只是偶尔会想他，会给他不再登录的聊天窗口发消息，每年也会去C市扫墓。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-04",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可是今天知道了这些，我突然觉得，之前那些日子好像全都不一样了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-05",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "……",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-06",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我一直以为他只是出了意外。我甚至想过，如果那时候我没有住院，会不会还能见到他最后一面；或者我和他一起回C市，就会拦住他在暴雨天上山，就不会有意外发生。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-07",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "现在您却告诉我，他本来就是为了救我才死的，他回C市，只是为了道别。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-08",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "那他为什么不问问我的想法？我又不是一定会答应。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-09",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "罗尧当时很害怕。害怕来不及，也害怕最后找到了办法，却没能把你留下来。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-11",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "他比任何人都希望你能继续活下去。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-12",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "那这算什么由我自己决定呢？",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-13",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "如果我接受了，我该怎么面对他为了我去死这件事？可如果我不接受，他付出的那些又算什么？我甚至没办法告诉他，我其实不想让他这样做。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-14",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "林琛，罗尧的选择并不意味着你欠他一条命。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-15",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可是我很难不这么想。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-16",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "您知道吗，我今天毕业了。今天上午，我还想走出校园后给他发消息，说我终于毕业了。我和他相识后的大部分时光都在东澜大学度过，这原是我最快乐、最怀念的地方。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-17",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "可我现在不知道该怎么怀念了。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-18",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "……",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-19",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "如果你愿意，可以先回去休息。今天不一定要把所有事情解决。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-20",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "谢谢您。但是我不想再承受这份不应得的遗产了。人各有命，算尽则死，已然不应存在的我继续活下去，这本就是扭曲生命的谬误。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-21",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "那归籍的事情……",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-22",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "……",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-23",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "我做不到。对不起。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-24",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "你不用向我道歉。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner_branch_b-final-25",
          "speakerId": "linchen",
          "text": "嗯，谢谢你告诉我这些。",
          "reviewStatus": "confirmed"
        }
      ],
      "nextNodeId": "OWNER_END_B",
      "legacyMessages": [
        {
          "messageId": "owner-b-01",
