          "text": "我知道了。",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-b-15",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "你不必现在就做最后的决定。",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
        },
        {
          "messageId": "owner-b-16",
          "speakerId": "owner",
          "text": "如果决定过来，提前告诉我一声就好。",
          "reviewStatus": "draft"
